id account-statement
title Check an account statement adds up
lang sutra
audience banks, credit unions, auditors
safety none
summary A COBOL statement record with a table of lines is built and read back exactly, then KRON checks to the cent that opening plus the lines equals the stated closing balance; a mismatch is held for a person.
inputs inputs.txt
step statement sutra statement.sutra same=statement.cpy export=st-opening:open,st-closing:close,st-line-amount:lines
step balance kron balance.k gate out=balanced evidence labels=checks
draft statement.sutra Write a Sutra record layout for the statement the user describes, with exact PICTURE clauses (s9(n)v99 for money) and a table of lines (name[n]:).
